Description: Translucent xbar-style desktop bar for X11
 Sidewing is a small GTK4 desktop bar for X11 multi-monitor Linux desktops.
 It runs local executable scripts as plugins, parses xbar-style stdout, and
 renders a translucent bar with per-plugin popover menus.
